WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
There's a deep sickness that's in this country right now.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.220
And it pains me a lot to acknowledge it.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.420
Yeah, the amazing thing is you look at Portland

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.300
and you see fires all over the place.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.100
You see fights and I mean, just violence.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.220
It's just so crazy.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.180
And then you talk to the governor

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.260
and she's acts like everything is totally normal.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.780
There's nothing wrong.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.700
It's almost like, are you waking up from a dream or something?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.860
You see it on your network.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.240
You see it all over the place and it's so bad.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:30.200
It's so crazy.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.400
It's like the movies you see for the kids.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.320
I guess not only the kids, adults also

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.520
where you have these bombed out cities

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.919
and these bombed out people.

00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:40.279
It's like worse than that.

00:00:40.279 --> 00:00:41.880
I don't think they could make a movie as bad.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.119
And then the governor will get up and say,

00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:47.040
I don't know why they're coming here.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.360
It's such a wonderful place.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.959
And the amazing thing is the people want us to be there.

00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:54.080
The people, when they get the real people that live there,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.599
many of them have left,

00:00:55.599 --> 00:00:57.360
but the real people want us to be.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.480
The same thing in Chicago.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.200
They've had 60, 70 murders over a short period of time,

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
murders, people that got shot.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.419
They've had hundreds of people shot.

00:01:08.419 --> 00:01:12.940
And then a guy like Pritzker or this low IQ mayor gets up.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:16.480
I mean, he got up, he's got a 5% approval rating

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.000
and the people are all against him.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.239
They want people to come.

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:24.160
Beautiful black women are wearing a MAGA hat

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.199
last night on television, beautiful people.

00:01:27.199 --> 00:01:30.000
And they said, we don't care who comes,

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.959
just stop the crime.

00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:31.839
They don't care, frankly,

00:01:31.839 --> 00:01:34.360
they don't care if it's National Guard, military,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.320
send in anybody you want, stop the crime.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.680
And they're afraid to go out, they can't even go out.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.040
And then a guy like Pritzker, think of that,

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.239
50, 60, 70 people over a short period of time murdered,

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.879
actually murdered, mostly gun violence,

00:01:48.879 --> 00:01:51.480
but knives, but gun violence, they're murdered.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.500
And hundreds of people shot.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.660
They had one weekend where they had like 18 murdered

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.099
and 71 shot.

